  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_355488a250104592a2cb4b370edfc948",
      "statement": "The Ulabase Vue starter uses a declarative setup file (ulabase.setup.ts) that configures an Ulabase service with an idempotent step/check/apply pattern, where each step has a check that returns true when the service already matches the desired state and an apply that makes the change only when check returned false.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:c19d7a723379ef50525a3357df2772b9827c5975e04176521597a5cd32452b87"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4963f8757cea4ebc92f0467fcee28ea3",
      "statement": "The ulabase.setup.ts file imports the app's environment.ts and derives server-side feature toggles from it, eliminating drift between client and server configurations by declaring flags once in a single source of truth.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/environments/environment.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:0b2fba9c71fd1b63438cbadf37ac7d0e703467000d83ce4857c4f401ba517d4e"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L34-L35",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4729d32c20d6b55b781aed2e394385c9590db86873c8c17076c9751e4c813716:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L42-L64",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e0b68f36e86e6a4614edad6e3216a35a5a0cda3a5b466a701b2daf6731b75b8c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ac13788750914ab198ed73da35922c5a",
      "statement": "The setup performs six ordered steps: install the accounts feature, write APP_NAME into the Branding feature's name, configure accounts to match the app, conditionally configure Google OAuth credentials, add the app origin to the allowlist, and write the service URL into environment.ts's apiUrl field via the exported appPointsAtService step (placed last so a partial setup leaves the 'Connect your service' screen visible rather than a sign-up page that fails).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L96-L230",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c85ce0a64af25e5bf9bb061a96842c8b6c9561c1f57a0836e9cb15620c38561c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9f58dc6309db44a6a8a1b05f82647ec5",
      "statement": "The --dry-run flag runs only the checks without applying changes, answering 'what is this service missing?' without touching the service configuration.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L48-L49",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:73c45447d05e590d7124a6ebce3a69910cc6be17d4b08f0c1c1be1966576c90b:"
