      "id": "claim_7d96ad4421ad4ce1a6cef10e87c72aea",
      "statement": "The first-run setup process requires Node.js 22.18 or later, a free Ulabase service account, and follows four steps: clone/install, create service, run ulabase setup --srv <srvId>, and start the dev server with npm run dev.",
