    {
      "id": "claim_9609f2196d49402f8310d7345248adcb",
      "statement": "The setup writes APP_NAME (default 'Ulabase Starter') into the Branding feature's name by reading the current branding document and merging into it ({ ...current, name: APP_NAME }), so a color or logo set in the console survives; the name appears on the sign-in page and in every email the service sends.",
