    {
      "id": "claim_1845fcac94224a5a930f5a9c2edb71c3",
      "statement": "In the consents setup, the JWT claims latestConsents/tos and latestConsents/pp are added to the auth feature's account-properties-claims via getFeatureConfig/updateFeatureConfig, merged with any claims the service already carries and never replacing them, so the guard compares consent versions from the token rather than reading the database.",
